= Nord Stream pipeline explodes

The Nord Stream gas pipeline, one of the most important pipelines conducting gas from <span style="color: [+ russia_color_1 +];">**Ru**</span><span style="color: [+ russia_color_2 +];">**ss**</span><span style="color: [+ russia_color_3 +];">**ian**</span> to the <span style="color: [+ eu_color_1 +];">**European**</span><span style="color: [+ eu_color_2 +];">**Union**</span> through the Baltic Sea, has experienced an enormous leak after a series of underwater explosions. In a day, gas prices throughout Europe have risen by 12%.

With so much vested interest behind it, and only half a year after the start of the war, this event is quite the interesting coincidence.

